# GUBERA VASAL Real Estate Platform Environment Configuration
# Set in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables

# 1. Primary: Render Backend API Endpoint (Node.js + Supabase)
# Example: https://gubera-vasal-api.onrender.com/api (or http://localhost:5000/api for local testing)
VITE_API_URL=https://your-render-app.onrender.com/api

# 2. Optional Secondary / Fallback: Google Apps Script Web App Endpoint
# VITE_GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_SCRIPT_ID/exec
